    <item>
      <title>程式碼共用</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/posts/2022-04-30-4/</link>
      <pubDate>Sat, 30 Apr 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/2022-04-30-4/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;繼上一篇淺談程式可讀性，我發覺，與其去談怎麼樣變成一個軟體工程大師，倒不如談談怎樣不要寫出雷雷的東西，比較容易也比較不會有什麼大爭議。軟體工程對於大師還是有不同的層次與見解，滿難去定義的，但是日常維護程式的痛，大家的經驗應該都滿類似的。畢竟，遇到好的或是普通的程式通常不會有什麼特別的感覺（除非是真的遇到
masterpiece 且剛好看得懂），會被記住的都是那些難懂的程式碼。所以這篇就來談談也是很常見的「共用」程式碼議題。&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>繼上一篇淺談程式可讀性，我發覺，與其去談怎麼樣變成一個軟體工程大師，倒不如談談怎樣不要寫出雷雷的東西，比較容易也比較不會有什麼大爭議。軟體工程對於大師還是有不同的層次與見解，滿難去定義的，但是日常維護程式的痛，大家的經驗應該都滿類似的。畢竟，遇到好的或是普通的程式通常不會有什麼特別的感覺（除非是真的遇到
masterpiece 且剛好看得懂），會被記住的都是那些難懂的程式碼。所以這篇就來談談也是很常見的「共用」程式碼議題。</p>
<p>每個工程師從開始學程式，到進入職場實戰，一定都有聽過程式碼要盡量能夠共用，才不會一樣的事情需要重複做。嚴格來說，這個概念從一開始學習函式時，就已經烙印在每個工程師的腦中了，舉一個簡單的例子：</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-java" data-lang="java"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kd">public</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="kd">static</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="kt">void</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nf">main</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">String</span><span class="o">[]</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">args</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">{</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">  </span><span class="c1">// 把 fibonacci sequence 的生成寫成函式以避免使用時都要重寫一遍</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">  </span><span class="n">IntStream</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">range</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">1</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">11</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">forEach</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">n</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">-&gt;</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">{</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">      </span><span class="n">System</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">out</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">println</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">String</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">format</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s">&#34;fib(%d) = %d &#34;</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">n</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">fibSeq</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">n</span><span class="p">)));</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="p">});</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w"></span><span class="p">}</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w"></span><span class="kd">public</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="kd">static</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="kt">int</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nf">fibSeq</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="kt">int</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">n</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="kd">throws</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">IllegalArgumentException</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">{</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">  </span><span class="k">if</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">n</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">&lt;</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">0</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="k">throw</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="k">new</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">IllegalArgumentException</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s">&#34;n should be greater or equal to 0&#34;</span><span class="p">);</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">  </span><span class="k">else</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="k">if</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">n</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">==</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">0</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">||</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">n</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">==</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">1</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="k">return</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">1</span><span class="p">;</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">  </span><span class="k">else</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="k">return</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">fibSeq</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">n</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="n">1</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">+</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">fibSeq</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">n</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="n">2</span><span class="p">);</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w"></span><span class="p">}</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span></code></pre></div><p>程式碼重複利用，絕對是軟體工程裡非常重要的一件事。它可以大幅增加生產力，以及降低錯誤的發生率，就算中間有
bug，也很容易在修改一個地方之後，其他有使用到這個函式的地方也一併修好了。而學完函式，進入物件導向的世界後，消除重複程式碼的工具又多了不少種，像是繼承或泛型都是常用的手段，而最易「入手」的就是繼承。由於物件導向是以物件為主，「繼承」如此自然、好聯想、且容易在原有程式下擴充的特性，讓非常多工程師想優先透過繼承的手法來共用程式碼片段。但錯誤地共用程式，往往會造成後續維護的大問題。主要的原因有以下幾個：</p>
<ol>
<li>不太像的東西硬要共用</li>
<li>看到很像的東西就想共用</li>
<li>以上的情況，再用「繼承」來共用</li>
</ol>
<p>以下，我就針對這三點說明及給些例子！</p>
<h2 id="不太像的東西也硬要共用">不太像的東西也硬要共用</h2>
<p>真的假的？這是在幹麼？XD</p>
<p>這的確是實務上常出現的情況哦！有些工程師太想要達成「共用」，就算兩段程式看起來只有 30%
的相似，也還是要把他們抽出成一個函式。畢竟，只要函式的參數夠多，再怎麼樣不能共用的東西，也能抽成一個函式呀！於是，很可能可以看到這種程式碼（是個很不 ok
的例子）：</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-java" data-lang="java"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kd">private</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">String</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nf">getQuery</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">String</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">target</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">String</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">condition</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="kt">int</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">returnCnt</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">{</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">  </span><span class="c1">// 為了你的程式安全著想，實務上千萬別這樣寫 SQL 去 query DB...這只是範例</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">  </span><span class="k">return</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">String</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">format</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s">&#34;SELECT * FROM %s WHERE %s LIMIT %d;&#34;</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">target</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">condition</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">returnCnt</span><span class="p">);</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w"></span><span class="p">}</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w"></span><span class="c1">// 使用的時候…</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w"></span><span class="kd">public</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">String</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nf">getAdultsQuery</span><span class="p">()</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">{</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">  </span><span class="k">return</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">getQuery</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s">&#34;users&#34;</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="s">&#34;age &gt;= 18&#34;</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">10</span><span class="p">);</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w"></span><span class="p">}</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w"></span><span class="kd">public</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">String</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nf">getComicBooksQuery</span><span class="p">()</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">{</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">  </span><span class="k">return</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">getQuery</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s">&#34;books&#34;</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="s">&#34;type = \&#34;comics\&#34;&#34;</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">10</span><span class="p">);</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w"></span><span class="p">}</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span></code></pre></div><p>這樣的共用方式，會導致 <code>getAdultsQuery</code> 和 <code>getComicBooksQuery</code> 兩個東西被 couple 在一起，當今天
<code>getAdultsQuery</code>
不需要撈回全部欄位的時候，這個共用函式只有兩條路：一是修改這個函式需要帶的參數，另一個就是沒辦法再共用這個函式。假設選擇了前面修改參數這條路，那麼程式會變成這樣：</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-java" data-lang="java"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kd">private</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">String</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nf">getQuery</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">String</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">columns</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">String</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">target</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">String</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">condition</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="kt">int</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">returnCnt</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">{</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">  </span><span class="k">return</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">String</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">format</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s">&#34;SELECT %s FROM %s WHERE %s LIMIT %d;&#34;</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">columns</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">target</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">condition</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">returnCnt</span><span class="p">);</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w"></span><span class="p">}</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w"></span><span class="c1">// 使用的時候…</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w"></span><span class="kd">public</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">String</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nf">getAdultsQuery</span><span class="p">()</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">{</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">  </span><span class="k">return</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">getQuery</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s">&#34;name, age&#34;</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="s">&#34;users&#34;</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="s">&#34;age &gt;= 18&#34;</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">10</span><span class="p">);</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w"></span><span class="p">}</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w"></span><span class="kd">public</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">String</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nf">getComicBooksQuery</span><span class="p">()</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">{</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">  </span><span class="k">return</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">getQuery</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s">&#34;*&#34;</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="s">&#34;books&#34;</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="s">&#34;type = \&#34;comics\&#34;&#34;</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">10</span><span class="p">);</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w"></span><span class="p">}</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span></code></pre></div><p>變成這樣，其實也沒有真的共用什麼東西了，反而讓程式碼變得難以閱讀及維護。針對這一點，當抽出的共用函式的參數太多且彼此間關聯很薄弱的時候，就要有所警覺：是否這兩段程式碼不該共用？</p>
<h2 id="看到很像的東西就想共用">看到很像的東西就想共用</h2>
<p>很像的東西，不就可以抽成共用嗎？這可就大錯特錯了。有的時候，就算長得一模一樣，也未必是應該要抽成共用的。能不能共用，要看的是這個行為的「意圖」是否是一樣的，若只是剛好長得一樣而意圖不同，那只要其中一邊稍有調整，這段程式碼立刻就又會分道揚鑣。</p>
<p>這邊舉個例子，某線上商城的會員制度分為「一般會員」及「VIP 會員」，若今天不同資格的訂定方式有兩種：</p>
<ol>
<li>「一般會員」可以享商品九折優惠，滿三千免運費。「VIP 會員」可以享商品九折優惠，滿三千免運費，滿五千整筆訂單再打八五折。</li>
<li>「一般會員」可以享商品九折優惠，滿三千免運費。「VIP 會員」除了享有「一般會員」的權利之外，還能多享有滿五千整筆訂單再打八五折。</li>
</ol>
<p>以上 1 和 2 的對於一般會員和 VIP 會員的條件是一模一樣的，但在 1 的情境之下， VIP 會員不該和一般會員共用前半段優惠的算式，在 2
的情境下則可以。因為 1 的情境下，一般會員和 VIP 會員的「享商品九折優惠，滿三千免運費」是剛好一樣但本質不一樣。而在 2
裡面的才是真的一樣。最簡單看出這差異的方式是，假設今天調整了一般會員的優惠變成了「享商品九五折」，在 1 的條款下 VIP
會員仍享有商品九折優惠，滿三千免運費，但 2 就沒有了。若沒分清楚 1 和 2 的差異，在實作 1 時用了 2 的作法，就有可能發生「改 A 壞
B」的情況了（改了一般會員的權利不小心也動到 VIP 會員的）。</p>
<p>所以當想要把兩個看起來很像的東西，或是一樣的東西抽成共用的時候，先試想一些極端情況來看看這兩個東西還是否一樣。若還是能保持一致的話，那麼抽成共用就不會有什麼大問題，反之，可能就要再斟酌一下下，或是看是否有更小幅度、但確實是真正的可共用的部分。</p>
<h2 id="利用繼承共用">利用繼承共用</h2>
<p>關於繼承的「危害」，有許多的不錯的文章已經探討過了，繼承關係會讓這兩個類別產生強藕合，若使用不當，只能享受其「共用」好處的一部分，而同時讓程式難以理解及修改。</p>
<p>其實最主要的錯不在繼承，而是一般在使用時，很少人會真正仔細地去思考里式替代原則 (Liskov Substitution Principle,
LSP)。什麼是里式替代原則？原文如下：</p>
<p><img alt="Let  \\phi(x) be a property provable about objects x of type T. Then\n\\phi(y) should be true for objects y of type S where S is a subtype of\nT." loading="lazy" src="https://latex.codecogs.com/svg.image?\\\\text{Let&space;}\\\\phi\\(x\\)\\\\text{&space;be&space;a&space;property&space;provable&space;about&space;objects&space;}x\\\\text{&space;of&space;type&space;}T\\\\text{.}&space;\\\\\\\\\\\\text{Then&space;}\\\\phi\\(y\\)\\\\text{&space;should&space;be&space;true&space;for&space;objects&space;}y\\\\text{&space;of&space;type&space;}S\\\\text{&space;where&space;}S\\\\text{&space;is&space;a&space;subtype&space;of&space;}T\\\\text{.}"></p>
<p>原始嚴謹的定義是如此，但在 OOP
的脈絡中簡單的大意是說，子類別繼承下來的行為，應該要保持和父類別一樣，在一個使用父類別的程式中，把父類別抽換成子類別後，其結果不會被影響（在這個意義下，子類別和父類別是可互相替代的）。這裡的父類別包含一般類別、抽象類別
(Abstract Class) 及介面（Interface） 。在常見的介紹里式替換的文章裡，通常都會用 Shape / Square /
Rectangle 算面積作為範例，而這樣簡單的範例就已和一般直覺的行為不同了，所以在使用繼承時，沒有好好地釐清兩個 class
之前的關係的話，通常都會誤用。因此現在一般都會認為若無法百分之百確定兩者的關係，不如使用「組合」 (composition /has-A)
取代「繼承」(is-A)。</p>
<p>但更多時候，很多工程師連想到要去思考這個關係都沒有，單純只是想要「共用」。一個常見的利用繼承共用的例子如下：原本有一個 Controller 會先用
user ID 取出其 User 的 meta 資料，再拿出他追蹤的前十個使用者資料。新的需求是要有一個新的 Controller ，先用 user ID
取出其 User 的 meta 資料，再拿出他按讚的貼文。原本的程式可能長得像這樣：</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-java" data-lang="java"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kd">public</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="kd">class</span> <span class="nc">FollowedUserController</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">{</span><span class="w">  
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">  </span><span class="kd">public</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">UserMetaRepo</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">userMetaRepo</span><span class="p">;</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="c1">// assigned in the constructor</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">  </span><span class="kd">public</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">UserRepo</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">userRepo</span><span class="p">;</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="c1">// assigned in the constructor</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">  </span><span class="kd">public</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">List</span><span class="o">&lt;</span><span class="n">User</span><span class="o">&gt;</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nf">getFollowedUsers</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">String</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">userId</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">{</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="k">return</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">userMetaRepo</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">getFollowedUserIds</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">userId</span><span class="p">).</span><span class="na">stream</span><span class="p">()</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">      </span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">map</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">userRepo</span><span class="p">::</span><span class="n">getUser</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">      </span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">collect</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">toList</span><span class="p">());</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">  </span><span class="p">}</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w"></span><span class="p">}</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span></code></pre></div><p>新的需求，在前半段基本上是一樣的！都是要先去用 user ID 拿回 user meta，所以就有一種改法會是長這個樣子：</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-java" data-lang="java"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kd">public</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="kd">class</span> <span class="nc">UserMetaController</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">{</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">  </span><span class="kd">private</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">UserMetaRepo</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">userMetaRepo</span><span class="p">;</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="c1">// assigned in the constructor</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">  </span><span class="kd">protected</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">List</span><span class="o">&lt;</span><span class="n">UserMeta</span><span class="o">&gt;</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nf">getUserMeta</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">String</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">id</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">{</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="k">return</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">userMetaRepo</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">getFollowedUserIds</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">id</span><span class="p">);</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">  </span><span class="p">}</span><span class="w"> 
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w"></span><span class="p">}</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w"></span><span class="kd">public</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="kd">class</span> <span class="nc">FollowedUserController</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="kd">extends</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">UserMetaController</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">{</span><span class="w">  
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">  </span><span class="kd">public</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">UserRepo</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">userRepo</span><span class="p">;</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="c1">// asigned in the constructor</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">  </span><span class="kd">public</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">List</span><span class="o">&lt;</span><span class="n">User</span><span class="o">&gt;</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nf">getFollowedUsers</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">String</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">id</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">{</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="k">return</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">getUserMeta</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">id</span><span class="p">).</span><span class="na">stream</span><span class="p">()</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">      </span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">map</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">userRepo</span><span class="p">::</span><span class="n">getUser</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">      </span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">collect</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">toList</span><span class="p">());</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">  </span><span class="p">}</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w"></span><span class="p">}</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w"></span><span class="kd">public</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="kd">class</span> <span class="nc">LikedPostController</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="kd">extends</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">UserMetaController</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">{</span><span class="w">  
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">  </span><span class="kd">public</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">PostRepo</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">postRepo</span><span class="p">;</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="c1">// asigned in the constructor</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">  </span><span class="kd">public</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">List</span><span class="o">&lt;</span><span class="n">Post</span><span class="o">&gt;</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nf">getLikedPosts</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">String</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">id</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">{</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="k">return</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">getUserMeta</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">id</span><span class="p">).</span><span class="na">stream</span><span class="p">()</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">      </span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">map</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">postRepo</span><span class="p">::</span><span class="n">getLikedPost</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">      </span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">collect</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">toList</span><span class="p">());</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">  </span><span class="p">}</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w"></span><span class="p">}</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span></code></pre></div><p>可以看到，<code>FollowedUserController</code> 和 <code>LikedPostController</code> 在概念上完全不同的東西，因為「實作」的相似而透過
<code>UserMetaController</code> 被藕合在一起了。這產生了兩個問題：</p>
<ul>
<li>一個還未爬完整個 code base 的人，會無法了解為什麼 <code>UserMetaController</code> 和 <code>FollowedUserController/LikedPostController</code> 有什麼關係？而這個繼承關係也並不直覺。</li>
<li>未來若 <code>LikedPostController</code> 的使用流程改變，改成可以直接用 user ID 去 <code>postRepo </code>拿到相對應的 posts，但 <code>FollowedUserController</code> 的流程沒有改變，此時整個繼承關係都要修改。</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="要怎麼共用">要怎麼共用？！</h2>
<p>這樣一講，感覺好像很多都不能共用了吧？</p>
<p>其實以上雖然看似三點，但其實背後都是相同的道理：共用的準則，就是要深入地好好想看看，你準備抽出來的程式碼片段，他是在「意圖」上是相同的，還是只是「實作」上相同？若是「意圖」上相同，抽取出來共用就沒有問題，但若只是「實作」上相同，而意圖上不同的話，這樣最好是不要抽成共用，或是拆解成「意圖」與「實作」相符的
Utility Class 比較好。</p>
<p>比如以前面 SQL Query 的例子來說，若抽成共用是以<strong>產生 Query 的 Utility</strong> 的角度來下手，意圖從「共用
<code>getAdultsQuery</code> 和 <code>getComicBooksQuery</code> 的實作」轉變成「共用產生 SQL Query
的工具」，這樣會抽取的共用程式碼目的及擺放的位置都會不同（很自然地就不會把他放在一個 XXXXBase 的父類別裡），比如可以產生一個 fluent
query builder library 來讓程式碼易用：</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-java" data-lang="java"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kd">class</span> <span class="nc">class</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">SQLQueryBuilder</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">{</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">  </span><span class="c1">// impl.</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w"></span><span class="p">}</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w"></span><span class="kd">public</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">String</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nf">getAdultsQuery</span><span class="p">()</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">{</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">  </span><span class="k">return</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">qb</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">select</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s">&#34;name&#34;</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="s">&#34;age&#34;</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">from</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s">&#34;users&#34;</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">where</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s">&#34;age&#34;</span><span class="p">).</span><span class="na">ge</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">18</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">limit</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">10</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">build</span><span class="p">();</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w"></span><span class="p">}</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w"></span><span class="kd">public</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">String</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nf">getComicBooksQuery</span><span class="p">()</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">{</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">  </span><span class="k">return</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">qb</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">select</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s">&#34;*&#34;</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">from</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s">&#34;books&#34;</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">where</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s">&#34;type&#34;</span><span class="p">).</span><span class="na">eq</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s">&#34;comics&#34;</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">limit</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">10</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">build</span><span class="p">();</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w"></span><span class="p">}</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span></code></pre></div><p>以上幾種常見的共用誤區你有沒有踩到呢？下次打算要重構抽取共用程式碼時，可以停下來多想想，避免寫出之後很難改動的共用程式！</p>
